    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WEST COAST\nAIRLINES\nROUTE\n+\nFAST, FREQUENT SERVICE TO IDAHO, OREGON AND WASHINGTON\nTHE SCENIC LINERS\nPASSENGERS • AIR MAIL\nAIR FREIGHT • AIR EXPRESS\nA SCHEDULED AIRLINE\nAPN 25. 195%",
      "PORT\nANGELES\nBUILDING A NEW WEST COAST EMPIRE\nWASHINGTON\nSPOKANE\nCOEUR\nd'ALENE\nABERDEEN\nHOQUIAM\n* SEATTLE EPHRATA\nMOSES LAKE\nELLENSBURG\nOLYMPIA\nWENATCHEE\n*YAKIMA\nPULLMAN- MOSCOW\nCENTRALIA\nCHEHALIS\nPASCO\nASTORIA\nRICHLAND\nKENNEWICK\nCLARKSTON\nM LEWISTON\nWALLA\n- WALLA\nPENDLETON\n** PORTLAND\nVANCOUVER\nLA GRANDE\nALBANY• CORVALLIS\nTHE SCENIC LINERS\nEUGENE\nNORTH BEND\n\"COOS BAY\nOREGON\nBAKER\nTHE ROUTE\nONTARIO\n• IDAHO\nPAYETTE\nIDAHO FALLS\nBOISE\nROSEBURG\nTWIN FALLS\nBURLEY\nRUPERT\nMEDFORD\nKLAMATH FALLS\nWest Coast Airlines Grows with the Pacific Northwest\nHow West Coast Airlines Service to \"Paul Bunyan's Empire\"\nhas grown! Below is the combined record of revenue passen-\ngers carried by West Coast: Airlines and Empire Air Lines,\nnow one company. A total of 787,059 through 1953, and\nsengers carried.\nthis year West Coast will near the one million mark in pas-\n1947\n1948\n53,130\n1949\n90,670\n1951\n1952\n1950\n99,661\n121,658\n146,236\n111,858\nAir Lines\n1953\n163,846*\n*First full year of combined operations, West Coast Airlines and Empire\nWEST COAST\nAIRLINES\nPOCATELLO"
